=== conversion wrapper help ===
usage: migrate_clips_to_pvb_pairs.py [-h] --input-root INPUT_ROOT
                                     --output-root OUTPUT_ROOT [--overwrite]

Convert current npz-v1 clips into the original PVB gzip-JSON pair store. This
is an external data adapter. It does not import or modify PVB_origin. Each
T=16 clip contributes exactly T-1 adjacent pairs, preserving the stored atom
order, topology, coordinates, masks, and native physical interval.

options:
  -h, --help            show this help message and exit
  --input-root INPUT_ROOT
  --output-root OUTPUT_ROOT
  --overwrite
